## Key Concepts

- Real-time WebSocket testing at scale (1k streams)
- Strict per-tenant data isolation to prevent leakage
- Dynamic RBAC changes mid-session and their immediate effects
- Deterministic data seeds for repeatable tests
- Network throttling and latency percentile validation

## Code Example

